| '''Case/switch statement''' — see Case Statement
|-
| <code>d</code>
| '''Data read queue''' — see Data / Read Queue
|-
| <code>e</code>
| '''Emote''' (send chat as another name) — see Additional Command Families
|-
| <code>h</code>
| Hash table set
|-
| <code>i</code>
| '''Information Request''' — pause the script and ask the player for a target/query — see Information Requests
|-
| <code>l</code>
